tool.help:
@GENEFIOR_HELP@
**Recompute**
GeneFior-Recompute takes prior GeneFíor or AMRfior result files and recalculates detection statistics with new thresholds. This avoids re-running the alignment tools — only the detection/evidence classification is updated.
Provide the detection matrix (and optionally the evidence matrix, evidence summary, and allele resolution) from a previous run, adjust the threshold parameters, and the tool will produce updated detection and evidence matrices.
@ATTRIBUTION@
